    "body": "Add GCA_ANNOUNCE_RESPONSE_MAX_SIZE to capture the true upper bound of a GCA-extended announce response, and allocate the response buffer dynamically to match the exact plaintext size rather than using the non-GCA constant. Update onion_client.c to accept responses up to the new bound. Add a group announce response size test.\n\n<!-- Reviewable:start -->\n- - -\nThis change is [<img src=\"https://reviewable.io/review_button.svg\" height=\"34\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"Reviewable\"/>](https://reviewable.io/reviews/TokTok/c-toxcore/3050)\n<!-- Reviewable:end -->\n",
